WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.829
Watch and read: For your describing practice, choose a describing word for the mango.

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:10.073
The answer is: yellow. A describing word tells us more about an object.

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:15.156
Watch and read: For your school practice, you are looking for books to borrow at

00:00:15.156 --> 00:00:16.838
school. What is the best answer?

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:22.721
The answer is: the library. Read the instruction carefully and choose the helpful or

00:00:22.721 --> 00:00:23.439
correct response.
